# Both developers' clones must see byte-identical source, or every content fingerprint in
# codemap/gen/*.jsonl differs between machines and each regeneration conflicts with the other.
# Blobs in this repo are already LF; this pins the working copy to LF on Windows too, which
# also silences git's "LF will be replaced by CRLF" warnings. Existing CRLF files in a
# working copy stay CRLF until git next rewrites them; `git add --renormalize .` is safe
# (blobs do not change) if you want it done at once.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never normalise binaries.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.nd2 binary
*.npy binary
*.npz binary
*.h5 binary
*.pt binary
*.pth binary
*.onnx binary
*.zip binary
*.pdf binary
